{
  "id": 8867180347591,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 25",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-25",
  "body_html": "<p>Experience ultimate comfort and style with the Jeminise Personalized Baseball Comforter Set. This bedding set, perfect for baseball players and fans, combines soft, durable materials with a spirited design, making it an ideal gift or a fantastic addition to any sports-themed room.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A thoughtful present for baseball lovers, men, women, moms, dads, and perfect for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques for long-lasting dye and fade prevention, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric for a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel, with Whole-Piece Microfiber Filling that prevents clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat for quick drying and enhanced fluffiness. For best results, wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Includes options for two text inputs for personalization.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a dynamic Baseball pattern, perfect for sports decor.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
